[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5344.39, "timestamp": "01:29:04", "text": "選單。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5349.03, "timestamp": "01:29:09", "text": "是的。所以這取決於你擁有什麼以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5350.79, "timestamp": "01:29:10", "text": "你需要什麼。但我真的很喜歡用“是”和“否”或“真”和“假”，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5352.709, "timestamp": "01:29:12", "text": "因為這種"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5355.11, "timestamp": "01:29:15", "text": "切換方式用起來更有趣，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.03, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "更改起來也更快，而且在這種情況下也更合理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.59, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "所以，這算是一個升級，但用 Figma 創建變體仍然非常簡單。現在，讓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5363.51, "timestamp": "01:29:23", "text": "我們再進一步，看看如何使用元件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.189, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "屬性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5372.07, "timestamp": "01:29:32", "text": "。我這裡有個按鈕。它裡面有"}]